# i18n Strings

All user-visible strings MUST use the `t()` function from `next-intl`. String literals are forbidden directly in JSX.

## Why
Enables multi-language support and centralizes UI text management. Default locale: `zh-CN`.

## Examples
// ❌ BAD
<Button>Save</Button>

// ✅ GOOD
const t = useTranslations('Common');
<Button>{t('save')}</Button>
